  displayName: Demodragon
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e00d9c7e39aa0824081bbcf0b9eda97d, type: 3}
  description: Demodragons are colossal demons, sometimes mistaken for dragonkin,
    truly massive creatures combining draconic bulk with infernal corruption. They
    have a thick, bladed tail and two vast, tattered wings, and move with a heavy,
    but still sure-footed gait before launching themselves skyward. Their presence
    is heralded by unearthly roars that carry both dragon fury and demonic resonance.
